# Web presence (web/landing, web/docs) — Node toolchain artefacts.
# Committed under web/: the sources, the lockfile, and each site's own copies
# of the logo and screenshots. Generated: everything below.
node_modules/
.astro/
web/*/dist/
web/*/.output/
web/*/.vercel/
web/*/.netlify/
.pnpm-store/
npm-debug.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Announcement drafts. These are one-off posts written for a launch — an Arch
# Forums thread, a release note — that get pasted somewhere and are done. They
# were tracked briefly and removed upstream; they stay on disk so the wording
# survives for the next release, and out of git so drafts nobody will read
# again do not accumulate in the history.
announcements/
